// AGP 9 compiles Kotlin itself. There is no `org.jetbrains.kotlin.android` plugin here
// and adding one back is a hard configuration error, not a warning.
//
// This buildscript classpath pins the Kotlin toolchain AGP uses. Without it AGP falls
// back to its own bundled KGP, which is older than the compose and serialization
// compiler plugins below — and a compiler plugin built against a different Kotlin
// version fails at compile time, not configuration time, so it surfaces late.
buildscript {
